abstract: >-
  Native OpenSSL 3.5.5 QUIC measurement programs, archived datagram and TLS traces,
  certificate fixtures, analysis scripts, conditional model outputs and manuscript
  sources for post-quantum authentication under amplification and congestion constraints.
